WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.210 line:0
Ancient basement formed about one point seven billion years

00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:03.530 line:0
ago.

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:11.020 line:0
Sedimentary and volcanic cover accumulated about one point one

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:11.960 line:0
billion years ago.

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:16.900 line:0
Tilting and erosion left an angular unconformity.

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:26.100 line:0
Paleozoic sandstone, shale, and limestone accumulated above the eroded

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:26.700 line:0
surface.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:33.660 line:0
Much later, the river cut through the old rocks.

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:40.340 line:0
The canyon walls preserve ancient events; their rock ages

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:41.940 line:0
do not give the age of canyon cutting.
